</span>
</h5>
<p class="note">Licensed The Luthas Center Therapist, Cynthia Catchings, LCSW-S, CFTP, CLYL, CMHIMP, is a Virginia and Texas Licensed Clinical Social Worker with over 10 years of experience in the mental health profession. In addition to her work at The Luthas Center, she is the Executive Director at the Women’s Emotional Wellness Center, with offices in the DC metro area and in Texas, and an Adjunct Professor at the University of Texas RGV, School of Social Work.</p>
