<li>Cool – The foam that it uses is cool and has a breathable mesh for ideal airflow.</li>
<li>Adjustable – You can zip or unzip the pillow for a firmer or softer pillow entirely mess-free.</li>
</ul><p>Even with all of this, these pillows are made out of China and shipped out by the company that’s in the US. As a result, you can expect delays and extra taxes when buying these pillows.</p>
<h3>5. Best Relaxing Pillow: CBD Pillow</h3>
